---
import IndustryLandscape from "../../../components/IndustryLandscape.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout locale="en" title="Industry Research | CAVWIC" description="Core English summaries for enterprise AI, embodied robotics, and dexterous hands." alternatePath="/industries">
  <header class="page-head"><div class="page-head-inner"><p class="eyebrow">INDUSTRY RESEARCH</p><h1>Three fields, one delivery discipline</h1><p>The full research library is reviewed in Chinese. These summaries state the decision framework and the evidence still required.</p></div></header>
  <div class="industries-content english-summaries">
    <section id="ai" class="industry-section"><div class="industry-section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">AI</p><h2>Enterprise AI</h2></div><p>RAG and agents are operational systems. A proposal must cover data ownership, access control, retrieval evaluation, tool permissions, cost, observability, fallback, and human takeover. A polished answer alone is not acceptance evidence.</p></div></section>
    <section id="robotics" class="industry-section"><div class="industry-section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">ROBOTICS</p><h2>Embodied robotics</h2></div><p>Robot capability is conditional on the site, task, payload, integration, safety system, recovery logic, and service model. A demo without an explicit failure script cannot establish deployability.</p></div><IndustryLandscape industry="robotics" locale="en" /></section>
    <section id="dexterous-hands" class="industry-section"><div class="industry-section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">DEXTEROUS HANDS</p><h2>Dexterous hands</h2></div><p>Degrees of freedom do not decide fit. Object geometry, contact strategy, tactile sensing, control interface, thermal limits, cycle life, maintainability, and a representative acceptance object set do.</p></div><IndustryLandscape industry="dexterous-hands" locale="en" /></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
